title: Beef and Broccoli - CSO Reheat
description: The easiest, tastiest way to reheat your leftover Beef and Broccoli dish. The steam-assisted reheat mode requires no oven preheat, and does not dry out your food like a dry oven, or ruining the texture and experience like a microwave.
---

Place the leftover beef and broccoli in an #oven-safe dish{}. Place in the #steam oven{} cavity on a wire rack set at position 2, or near the middle.

Set the REHEAT mode at 250°F and cook for ~{7-10%minutes}, tossing halfway through, until fully heated.
